{"title":"King Kragmaw","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">King Kragmaw is a named <a href=\"#/monster/troll-king\">Troll King</a> seen at level 49.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find King Kragmaw</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Kragmaw&#39;s Court</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 3×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5905\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"king-kragmaw\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mothsilk-head\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/71af5a9723b0e309552b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mothsilk Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/a8f3ca2a4c689dd4262a.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>King Kragmaw</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/troll-king\">Troll King</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>49</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>7,830</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>13 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}